# iDesk Code Quality Audit — Konsistensi, Maintainability, Type Safety

> Tanggal: 2026-04-30 | Scope: Backend + Frontend | Max 15 temuan
> Skip: performa, simplifikasi, bug (sudah di-audit terpisah)

---

## Konsistensi (5 temuan)

### K1. `@Req()` vs `@Request()` — Campur aduk di seluruh controller

**Evidence:**
- `@Req() req: any` → 50+ usage (vpn-access, users, sites, sla-config, renewal, reports, search, push-subscription)
- `@Request() req: any` → 40+ usage (ticketing, sound, settings, notifications, knowledge-base)

Keduanya identik secara fungsional (NestJS alias). Tapi inkonsisten bikin grep/refactor susah.

**Rule:** Pilih satu. `@Req()` lebih pendek, `@Request()` lebih eksplisit. Pilih salah satu, find-and-replace sisanya. **Effort: <30 menit.**

