### K3. Inline `@Body()` types vs DTO classes

~14 endpoint pakai inline type literal:
```typescript
// Inline — TIDAK divalidasi oleh ValidationPipe
@Body() body: { name: string; code: string }
@Body() body: { currentPassword: string; newPassword: string }
@Body() body: { ids: string[] }
@Body() body: { resolutionTimeMinutes: number }
@Body() body: { date: string }
@Body() body: { newEndDate: string; newStartDate?: string; ... }
```

File: [departments.controller.ts:31](file:///d:/iDesk-main/apps/backend/src/modules/users/departments.controller.ts#L31), [users.controller.ts:64](file:///d:/iDesk-main/apps/backend/src/modules/users/users.controller.ts#L64), [sla-config.controller.ts (ticketing):26](file:///d:/iDesk-main/apps/backend/src/modules/ticketing/presentation/sla-config.controller.ts#L26), [renewal.controller.ts:216](file:///d:/iDesk-main/apps/backend/src/modules/renewal/renewal.controller.ts#L216), [zoom-admin.controller.ts:86](file:///d:/iDesk-main/apps/backend/src/modules/zoom-booking/controllers/zoom-admin.controller.ts#L86)

Sementara 80%+ endpoint lain pakai DTO class dengan `class-validator` decorators.

**Rule:** Selalu pakai DTO class. Inline types bypass `ValidationPipe` — lihat section T3.

