### K5. SLA Config — Duplikasi route collision

Dua controller berbeda register di route **`sla-config`** yang sama:

| File | Route | Role Guard |
|------|-------|------------|
| [ticketing/presentation/sla-config.controller.ts](file:///d:/iDesk-main/apps/backend/src/modules/ticketing/presentation/sla-config.controller.ts) | `@Controller('sla-config')` | `@Roles(UserRole.ADMIN)` class-level |
| [sla-config/sla-config.controller.ts](file:///d:/iDesk-main/apps/backend/src/modules/sla-config/sla-config.controller.ts) | `@Controller('sla-config')` | `@Roles()` per-method (ADMIN + MANAGER) |

Method `update()` punya signature berbeda:
- Ticketing: `update(id, { resolutionTimeMinutes?, responseTimeMinutes? })`
- SLA-Config: `update(id, { resolutionTimeMinutes }, req.user)`

> [!WARNING]
> NestJS akan register keduanya. Request matching tergantung load order — **unpredictable behavior**. Salah satu harus dihapus atau digabung.

**Fix:** Hapus ticketing version (lebih sederhana, kurang lengkap). Pertahankan `sla-config` module version. **Effort: 30 menit.**

