## Maintainability (3 temuan)

### M1. `users.service.ts` — God Service (927 LOC)

[users.service.ts](file:///d:/iDesk-main/apps/backend/src/modules/users/users.service.ts) — 927 baris, flat structure, 7+ catch blocks.

Bandingkan: `ticketing` sudah split jadi `ticket-create.service.ts`, `ticket-update.service.ts`, `ticket-query.service.ts`, `ticket-notification.service.ts`.

**Tanggung jawab tercampur:**
- User CRUD
- Department management
- Role management
- Pagination + search
- Import/export (xlsx)
- Site assignment
- Password management

**Cost jika tidak di-refactor:** Setiap perubahan user-related butuh navigasi 900+ baris. Merge conflict risk tinggi (5 commits = file paling sering diubah ke-2).

**Saran split:**
| Service Baru | Responsibility |
|-------------|----------------|
| `user-crud.service.ts` | Create, update, delete, findOne, findAll |
| `user-import.service.ts` | Import/export xlsx |
| `user-password.service.ts` | Password reset, change, hashing |

**Effort: 3-4 jam. Benefit: high** — file ini sering berubah.

